ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Creo que el año de la rata va a ser
un buen año para mí.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}} ¡Después de
todo, ratas y ratones somos primos!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho deciso di fare molti più spuntini
a base di formaggio per il {{TAG:0004:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}
Questo sarà il mio anno!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Juhuuu, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ein neues Jahr beginnt!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}
{{TAG:0004:0000:}} ist das Jahr der Ratte!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ich bin 'ne richtige Leseratte...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Besonders Malbücher les ich gern,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
äh, he he he!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Senti il rumore che fa la mia coda?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Fruscia più che mai. E sai perché?
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Perché questo sarà il mio anno!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Das wird das Jahr des Büffels!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Au jaaa! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Essen Büffel eigentlich
{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}This is a special year for me!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}A huh huh! I hope it's a good one
too,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das Jahr des Pferdes geht los!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ich möcht am liebsten
losgaloppieren, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}so aufgeregt bin ich!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Sanki herkes bana bakıyor!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Demek ki bu yılın benim için özel
olduğunu onlar da anlamış!

IT:
Quest'anno tutto sarà diverso.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
I prossimi 12 mesi sono dedicati
esclusivamente a me.

DE:
Das Jahr des Affen geht los!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
Dieses Jahr bin ich bestimmt noch
quirliger als sonst, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}äh, he he he!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's totally gonna be my year!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I'm happy,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but I'm a little nervous
having all eyes on me.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu yıl kesin benim yılım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Çok mutluyum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ama bütün gözler üstümde diye
biraz da heyecanlıyım.

{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Bu yıl tam anlamıyla benim yılım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}
Bu da istediğim kadar {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}
yiyebileceğim demek!

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Yeni yıl kararlarımı epey düşündüm.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Belki{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
bu yıl mümkün olduğunca çok
{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}} yemeyi denemeliyim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bu yıl için bir kararın var mı,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Benim kararlarımdan biri{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}bir karar bulmak!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
Acaba gelecek yıla kadar bulabilir
miyim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
